{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1589","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"舍南舍北皆春水，但见群鸥日日来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"花径不曾缘客扫，蓬门今始为君开。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"盘飧市远无兼味，樽酒家贫只旧醅。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"肯与邻翁相对饮，隔篱呼取尽余杯。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔舍〕指诗人所居的成都浣花溪草堂。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔盘飧〕盘中菜肴。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔无兼味〕意思是菜肴很简单。兼味，两种以上的菜肴。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔旧醅（pēi）〕旧酿之酒。醅，没有过滤的酒，也泛指酒。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔肯〕乐意。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔余杯〕残酒，未饮完的酒。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"春水绕茅舍，但有群鸥来，这是“无人至”的意境，但也可看作客人将至的铺垫。不扫花径，因为无人来访；大开蓬门，则因今日有客。颔联呼应首联，仍然围绕“客至”两字展开。颈联笔锋一转，写客至之后的情形，描绘主人待客之简、家境之贫，对宾主脱略形迹、兴致盎然的场面则毫不着墨，纯由尾联唤取邻翁对饮暗示出来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"整首诗平白如话，看似信笔写来，其实结构紧凑，章法谨严，“前半见空谷足音之喜，后半见贫家真率之趣”（清黄生《唐诗摘抄》）。诵读这首诗，要仔细体味它是如何通过富于情趣的生活细节，表现主人待客的兴味与心境的。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"alt":"This is","mediaId":"media-be6ae17ffac3a32fe254","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"runs":[{"alt":"Two pages from an old book are filled with columns of traditional Chinese characters written vertically.","mediaId":"media-a8f58cebaaddc27d332b","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=206323","provider":"ctext","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=206323","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","type":"resource-link"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《杜诗详注》卷九（中华书局2015 年版）。客，指崔明府，杜甫的朋友。\n\n杜甫在题后自注说：“喜崔明府相过。”明府，汉魏以来对地方官员的敬称，唐以后多用以专指县令","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"alt":"This is","mediaId":"media-3374c29ebaeb82a65e50","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=206323","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=206323","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e5%ae%a2%e8%87%b3-%e6%9d%9c%e7%94%ab","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e5%ae%a2%e8%87%b3-%e6%9d%9c%e7%94%ab","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e5%ae%a2%e8%87%b3-%e6%9d%9c%e7%94%ab","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"This is","bytes":421732,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/0/086ebcc20278d9ff6c8037eae1a083a807cd3e26.png","height":828,"id":"media-3374c29ebaeb82a65e50","mediaType":"image/png","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"6ca16d0ee593d2f9f1b2330f3e52a7e649824b98232c09d255a3ccc6b39dfbc6","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/0/086ebcc20278d9ff6c8037eae1a083a807cd3e26.png","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1280},{"alt":"Two pages from an old book are filled with columns of traditional Chinese characters written vertically.","bytes":828651,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/2a778ce148c56b796d1098d15e1badfe78f8b476.jpeg","height":1620,"id":"media-a8f58cebaaddc27d332b","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"944582862eccccbef5e7c399d1b504b6b75f94